			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1173,
				41
			],
			"Message": "style(Cocoon): Normalise config JS to tab indentation with trailing commas\n\nReformat all Configuration/ESBuild/*.js, Configuration/Mountain/Config.js, and Source/ESBuild.js from 2-space indentation back to tab indentation, restoring the project convention. Alongside the indentation change:\n\n- Restore trailing commas to all array and object literals across every config file.\n- Reorder imports so re-exports (`export *`) appear after local imports in Cocoon.js and index.js, matching the convention used by sibling config files.\n- Normalise `node:path` import ordering to `{ posix, sep }` throughout.\n- Collapse Environment Constant.js named exports to a single-line block.\n- Wrap `__name` helper calls and long template expressions with consistent multi-line formatting at soft line widths (Compile Config.js, Mountain Config.js).\n\nRegenerate the RouteManifest timestamp (2026-05-22T05:18:10Z) and rebuild all Target/ compiled artifacts to reflect the reformatted configuration sources. No functional changes to build logic, RPC method registration (still 135 Mountain methods), or runtime behaviour.",
			"SHA": "f37eb88fd6025a5eb65e1c1a20dc7567c2c3a8bf"
		},
