			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-22T05:36:04Z",
			"File": [
				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1173,
				72
			],
			"Message": "feat(Cocoon): Wire extension host secrets, storage, provider dispatch, and live UI dialogs through Mountain\n\nReplace stubs across the Cocoon extension host with real implementations routed through Mountain's gRPC IPC:\n\n**Secrets & Storage** (`ActivateExtension.ts`): Extension secrets (`secrets.get/store/delete/onDidChange`) now round-trip via Mountain's AES-256-GCM encrypted storage with extension-scoped keys. Workspace/global state uses a local cache primed asynchronously from `Storage.Get`.\n\n**Extension Dependency Ordering** (`Extension/Host/Handler.ts`): Replace flat fire-and-forget activation with `ActivateWithDeps` — a recursive, depth-guarded (max 20) sequential activator that resolves `extensionDependencies` before the depending extension. Cycle-breaking via `InProgress` set.\n\n**Language Provider Resolution** (`Language/Provider/Handler.ts`): Add `$provideFileDecoration` and two-phase resolution handlers (`$resolveCodeAction`, `$resolveCodeLens`, `$resolveCompletionItem`, `$resolveHover`, `$resolveInlayHint`, `$resolveDocumentLink`, `$resolveWorkspaceSymbol`) so extension providers can return lightweight items that Monaco resolves for details.\n\n**Notification Handler** (`Notification/Handler.ts`): Track `window.focused/blurred` state via `__windowState`. Overhaul virtual document model in `$acceptModelChanged` — range-aware `getText()`, `lineAt()` with `range`/`firstNonWhitespaceCharacterIndex`/`isEmptyOrWhitespace`, `getWordRangeAtPosition()`, correct `offsetAt()`/`positionAt()`, `isUntitled` detection, language derivation from extension. Route `revealRange`/`showTextDocument` through `sendRequest` (Track effect) not `SendToMountain`. Add `$acceptTerminalOpened`/`$acceptTerminalClosed` handlers for UI-created terminal lifecycle.\n\n**Content Provider Routing** (`Request/Routing/Handler.ts`): Add `$provideTextDocumentContent` route that looks up the registered `__textDocumentContentProvider:{scheme}` and calls `provideTextDocumentContent` with a hydrated `Uri`.\n\n**VSCode API Namespaces:**\n- **Authentication**: Stash registered provider in `ExtensionRegistry` as `__authProvider:{id}` so `ExtHostAuthentication$getSession` can call `getSessions()`.\n- **Debug**: Stash debug config provider; forward `_TriggerKind` parameter.\n- **Languages**: `setLanguageConfiguration` now forwards through Mountain's `set_language_configuration` notification for Sky/Monaco relay.\n- **Tasks**: Stash task provider in `ExtensionRegistry` for `ExtHostTaskService$fetchTasks` callback.\n- **StatusBarItem** (`CreateStatusBarItem.ts`): Reactive getter/setter properties for `text`, `tooltip`, `command`, `backgroundColor`, `color` — each setter pushes an incremental `statusBar.update` to Mountain. `accessibilityInformation` stub added.\n- **Window** (`Window/Namespace.ts`): Live `showInformationMessage` with action buttons routes through `Window.ShowQuickPick` when actions are present. Live `createQuickPick`/`createInputBox` that open via `Window.ShowQuickPick`/`Window.ShowInputBox` round-trips and emit `onDidAccept`/`onDidChangeSelection`/`onDidHide` events. `showTextDocument` returns a full `TextEditor` shim with live `setDecorations()`, `edit()`, `insertSnippet()`, `revealRange()`, `show()` methods that dispatch through Mountain. Active tab getter returns a minimal `Tab` shape. `state` becomes a live getter backed by `__windowState`. Terminal creation fires `didOpenTerminal`/`didChangeActiveTerminal` events; dispose fires `didCloseTerminal`/`didChangeActiveTerminal`.\n- **Workspace/Providers**: Wire `onDidChange` handler on `TextDocumentContentProvider` — re-fetches content on provider change and emits `didChangeTextDocument` for virtual docs. Stash/unstash task providers on register/unregister.\n- **Workspace/Text/Document** (`Document.ts`): `openTextDocument({language, content})` creates an untitled in-memory document. `untitled:` scheme documents return synchronously from cache. Scheme-based provider dispatch queries `__textDocumentContentProvider:{scheme}` before falling back to disk/Mountain. `BuildSaveAll` routes through `Workspace.SaveAll`. `BuildApplyEdit` routes through Mountain's `applyEdit` Track effect (awaitable round-trip). `onWillSaveTextDocument` now supports `waitUntil` via `__willSaveListeners` array for format-on-save.\n\n**gRPC Server** (`GRPCServerService`): Route `$resolve*` methods alongside `$provide*` to language provider handler. Implement `ExtHostAuthentication$getSession` via stashed auth providers. Implement `ExtHostTaskService$fetchTasks/provideTasks/executeTask` via stashed task providers. Implement `ExtHostDebug$resolveDebugConfiguration/provideDebugConfigurations` via stashed debug config providers. Implement `ExtHostFileSystem$readFile/writeFile/stat/readDirectory/createDirectory/delete/rename/copy` via stashed file system providers. Add generic `ExtHost[A-Z]` fallback returning `null` instead of crashing on unknown methods.\n\n**Build**: Re-indent `ESBuild.js` from tabs to 4-space indentation. Regenerate `RouteManifest.ts` timestamp.\n\n388 Mountain RPC methods registered, 0 bespoke routes.",
